//! Union types over AST nodes.
//!
//! @generated by `cargo xtask codegen` from
//! `vendor/typescript-go/_scripts/ast.json`. Do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Upstream models these as an untyped `*ast.Node` plus a runtime kind
//! check. Modelling them as Rust enums is the central idiomatic-Rust bet
//! of this port: a `match` over `Expression` is exhaustive, so a new node
//! kind upstream becomes a compile error here rather than a silent
//! fallthrough.

#![allow(clippy::doc_markdown, clippy::large_enum_variant)]

